List a directory (or show one file) inside an ext2/3/4, erofs or f2fs image, without extracting it

Usage: android-doctor ls [OPTIONS] <IMAGE> [PATH]

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>  
  [PATH]   Path inside the image (default: the root) [default: /]

Options:
      --json      Print JSON instead of text
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
